o!"}, {"start": 445.47800000000007, "end": 446.47800000000007, "text": "Can you please call Audrey?"}, {"start": 446.47800000000007, "end": 448.47800000000007, "text": "Is sugar boots in my phone?"}, {"start": 448.47800000000007, "end": 449.47800000000007, "text": "That hurts, Shirley."}, {"start": 449.47800000000007, "end": 453.598, "text": "Oh, oh, I'll get it, because I am here for you."}, {"start": 453.598, "end": 457.35800000000006, "text": "We came so close to having one class that wasn't all about them."}, {"start": 457.35800000000006, "end": 459.0913333333334, "text": "Remember when they all took that fishing trip on St."}, {"start": 459.0913333333334, "end": 459.55800000000005, "text": "Patrick's Day?"}, {"start": 459.55800000000005, "end": 461.55800000000005, "text": "God, that was a good week."}, {"start": 461.55800000000005, "end": 463.67800000000005, "text": "This has got to be a Chang baby."}, {"start": 463.67800000000005, "end": 465.55800000000005, "text": "Changs are never born in hospitals."}, {"start": 465.55800000000005, "end": 469.838, "text": "More like taxi cabs, hardware stores, bank lines, sewers."}, {"start": 469.838, "end": 475.07800000000003, "text": "Mine if your chin was born on a treadmill at Bally Total Fitness, 20% incline."}, {"start": 475.07800000000003, "end": 477.23800000000006, "text": "Sugar boots says that he'll need us at the hospital."}, {"start": 477.23800000000006, "end": 478.23800000000006, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 478.23800000000006, "end": 479.23800000000006, "text": "Now can somebody do something about him?"}, {"start": 479.23800000000006, "end": 480.23800000000006, "text": "Don't you?"}, {"start": 480.23800000000006, "end": 481.23800000000006, "text": "Come to see him."}, {"start": 481.23800000000006, "end": 482.23800000000006, "text": "Nobody needs to freak out."}, {"start": 482.23800000000006, "end": 483.99800000000005, "text": "A Chang is hearty to the core."}, {"start": 483.99800000000005, "end": 485.19800000000